<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Acesso Bloqueado — SENAC Departamento Nacional</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #1a2744;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .icon-wrap {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      background: #fff0f0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
    }
    .icon-wrap svg {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      stroke: #c0392b;
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 1.8;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a2744;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
    .status {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #e24b4a;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .description {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555555;
      line-height: 1.75;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    hr {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
      margin: 1.25rem 0;
    }
    .ref-box {
      background: #f7f8fa;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #444444;
    }
    .ref-box p { margin: 5px 0; }
    .ref-box .label {
      color: #888888;
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 140px;
    }
    .ref-box .value {
      color: #1a2744;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .ref-loading {
      color: #aaaaaa;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #aaaaaa;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <img src="https://dn.senac.br/wp-content/themes/senac/images/logo-color-vertical.svg" alt="SENAC Departamento Nacional" style="height: 80px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
    <div class="icon-wrap">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
        <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/>
        <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h1>Acesso bloqueado</h1>
    <p class="status">403 &mdash; Forbidden</p>
    <p class="description">
      Sua solicita&ccedil;&atilde;o foi bloqueada pelas pol&iacute;ticas de seguran&ccedil;a do SENAC Departamento Nacional.<br><br>
      Se voc&ecirc; acredita que este bloqueio ocorreu por engano, entre em contato com a equipe respons&aacute;vel pela p&aacute;gina informando o c&oacute;digo de refer&ecirc;ncia abaixo.
    </p>
    <hr>
    <div class="ref-box">
      <p><span class="label">Institui&ccedil;&atilde;o:</span> <span class="value">SENAC Departamento Nacional</span></p>
      <p><span class="label">C&oacute;digo de refer&ecirc;ncia:</span> <span class="value"><span id="ref-id" class="ref-loading">obtendo...</span></span></p>
    </div>
    <p class="footer">Sistema de prote&ccedil;&atilde;o &mdash; Senac DN</p>
  </div>

  <script>
    fetch(window.location.href)
      .then(function(r) {
        var ref = r.headers.get('X-Azure-Ref');
        var el = document.getElementById('ref-id');
        if (ref) {
          el.textContent = ref;
          el.classList.remove('ref-loading');
        } else {
          el.textContent = 'indispon\u00edvel';
        }
      })
      .catch(function() {
        document.getElementById('ref-id').textContent = 'indispon\u00edvel';
      });
  </script>
</body>
</html>